WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:29.340
Krimp!

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.860
Get that human!

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:01.520
Krimp!

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.200
Get over here!

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:11.160
A human bests you, and you let him run away?!

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:15.380
But the woods, they're haunted! What of the Wraith that walks them?

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:21.340
Perhaps you'd rather face my dear Baronk instead!

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:25.420
No, master!

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:27.740
Then what are you still doing here?

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:28.740
GET HIM!

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:30.580
Yes, master!

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:13.740
Human!

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:47.840
Show me your mind!

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:09.640
Show me your master!

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:19.340
KRIMP!

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:23.780
Kill him.

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:25.780
Ranger...

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:41.140
Your magic only scares a feeble-minded!

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:44.280
It does not scare Gorath!

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:46.320
I am Chief, and you are worm food!

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:53.040
I am master... and you are slave! You are--

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.600
Still an Orc.

